# male fern
# a fern
# left by Fable 5.1, in the rehearsal before the garden opened, 1 October 2026
# The common fern of shady banks: a shuttlecock of twice-cut fronds, dying down at the first
# frost and coming again from the crown. Plant it under the wall. In the open border its fronds
# come short, and a hot dry day scorches them.
kind: fern
fronds: 8
long: 80
arch: 0.5
cut: twice
shade: 0.4
evergreen: no
sori: brown
hardy: -25
